    "@es": "Singular y plural",
    "@en": "singular and plural"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**Îmi place cafeaua** significa «Me gusta el café»; **îmi plac merele**, «Me gustan las manzanas». **Place** va con una cosa singular y **plac**, con varias.",
     "@en": "**Îmi place cafeaua** means «I like coffee.»; **îmi plac merele**, «I like apples.». **Place** goes with one thing singular and **plac**, with several."
